    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aRoboSoul: Chariot\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel-Style Co-op Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Story</strong><br>Little robots Blue and Red embark on a journey aboard their &quot;Chariot&quot; to the legendary Power Source, hoping to save their town from energy crisis. As a prequel to \u300aRoboSoul\u300b, this adventure reveals the origins of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Core Gameplay</strong><br>\u25b8 <strong>Dynamic Duo Control</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a single chariot together, seamlessly switching between 1 driver seat and 4 gunner positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seats transform into different functional modes based on each player's character (Blue/Red)<br>\u25b8 <strong>Cooperation &amp; Chaos</strong>:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based mayhem might accidentally eject your teammate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Requires perfect coordination for movement, attacks and energy management</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Enemies &amp; Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against the mechanical &quot;Resistron Army&quot; that stands in your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your chariot's capabilities through adventure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Key Features</strong><br>\u2022 Classic top-down pixel art style<br>\u2022 Deep integration between character traits and chariot modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The real challenge isn't the enemies - it's not getting yeeted by your teammate!&quot;</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aRoboSoul: Chariot\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel-Style Co-op Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Story</strong><br>Little robots Blue and Red embark on a journey aboard their &quot;Chariot&quot; to the legendary Power Source, hoping to save their town from energy crisis. As a prequel to \u300aRoboSoul\u300b, this adventure reveals the origins of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Core Gameplay</strong><br>\u25b8 <strong>Dynamic Duo Control</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a single chariot together, seamlessly switching between 1 driver seat and 4 gunner positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seats transform into different functional modes based on each player's character (Blue/Red)<br>\u25b8 <strong>Cooperation &amp; Chaos</strong>:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based mayhem might accidentally eject your teammate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Requires perfect coordination for movement, attacks and energy management</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Enemies &amp; Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against the mechanical &quot;Resistron Army&quot; that stands in your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your chariot's capabilities through adventure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Key Features</strong><br>\u2022 Classic top-down pixel art style<br>\u2022 Deep integration between character traits and chariot modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The real challenge isn't the enemies - it's not getting yeeted by your teammate!&quot;</i></p>",
    "short_description": "\u300aRoboSoul: Chariot\u300b Retro pixel co-op adventure! Control Blue &amp; Red piloting a transforming chariot (driver + 4 gunner seats) with slick morphing animations. Battle the Resistron Army - just don't fling your teammate off!",
